.TH ALX-DOCTOR 1 "November 2026" "Algothix OS 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
alx-doctor \- system health and performance diagnostics for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alx-doctor
[\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-root\fR \fIdir\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B alx-doctor
inspects the current ALX hardware profile, RAM availability, zram/swap state,
earlyoom status, disk type and free space, I/O scheduler udev rules, per-user
systemd resource limits, failed systemd units, active heavy services, and top
memory-consuming processes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit structured JSON instead of a human-readable table.
.TP
.BI \-\-root " dir"
Inspect an alternate root directory.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Display version information.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display usage information.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No FAIL checks detected.
.TP
.B 1
One or more FAIL checks detected.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR alx-tune (8)
